%h1 Component Examples

%h2#alerts Alerts

= v.alert(:danger, icon: "") do
  Oh no!

= v.alert(icon: "spinner", size: :md) do
  %p Integer laoreet erat ut ante tristique faucibus.
  %p Nunc at lectus in diam malesuada porta. Nullam maximus tellus ac ante ultricies, ut tristique nisl posuere.

= v.alert(:warning) do
  %p Fusce at neque finibus, lobortis est sit amet, scelerisque nibh.
  %ul
    %li Quisque fermentum vulputate aliquet. Suspendisse potenti.
    %li Aliquam ornare odio dolor, eget accumsan felis mattis in. Nulla volutpat non erat nec posuere. Phasellus a purus venenatis, rutrum lacus eget, ullamcorper ex.

%h2#profiles Profiles

%table.table
  %tr
    %td size: "lg"
    %td= v.profile(@profile, size: "lg")
  %tr
    %td size: "md"
    %td= v.profile(@profile, size: "md")
  %tr
    %td size: "sm"
    %td= v.profile(@profile, size: "sm")
  %tr
    %td size: "md"<br>with content
    %td
      = v.profile(@profile, url: "#", size: "md") do
        Created on #{Time.now}
  %tr
    %td size: "sm"<br>with content
    %td
      = v.profile(@profile, url: "#", size: "sm") do
        Created on #{Time.now}
  %tr
    %td Workspace
    %td= v.profile(@userspace)
